# ML experiments

## Logging

- Inside `mlflow.start_run()`, log params, validation metrics (log loss, Brier, accuracy, AUC), and the git SHA (`git_commit` tag).
- Model selection uses validation only. Do not read test (2025) metrics to pick a model.
- Log sklearn models with the reviewed skops trusted-types allowlist only (`REVIEWED_SKOPS_TRUSTED_TYPES`). An unknown type fails closed.
- A `--cv` invocation logs one parent run and one nested child per scored model. The parent holds `comparison.md`, `comparison.csv`, `best_feature_set`, and `data_digest`. Each child logs `decision` (`accepted`, `rejected`, `reference`, `baseline`, or `inconclusive`) and `log_loss_diff`, `log_loss_diff_ci_low`, `log_loss_diff_ci_high`. The same `data_digest` on the parent and the children means they used the same matrix. In the MLflow UI, filter with `tags.decision` and compare the child runs.

## Status

Phase 0 and Phase 1 are done. Phase 2 is in progress. Phases 3 and 4 are planned and not started. Do not invent their scope. H4 is the next experiment, and it is still inside Phase 2.

| Step | State | Reference |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Phase 0 input audit | done | n/a. Note: `docs/experiments/phase0_input_audit.md` |
| Phase 1 baselines | done | `baseline-home`. Note: `docs/experiments/phase1_baselines.md` |
| H1 differentials | rejected | logistic `current` |
| H2 season defense and regression | accepted | logistic `h2_full` is the reference from here on |
| H3 pass and rush EPA | rejected | logistic `h2_full` |
| Ridge, fold-tuned L2 | did not help | plain logistic `h2_full` stays the reference |
| H4 clean EPA | next, not implemented | logistic `h2_full` |

H3, CV 2016-2023, n=2191: logistic `h2_full` 0.6377. `h3_split` 0.6393 (difference +0.0016, interval -0.0009 to 0.0039). `h3_replace` 0.6395 (difference +0.0018, interval -0.0008 to 0.0043).

Ridge, same window: `logistic_l2` on `h2_full` is 0.6386 (difference +0.0009, interval -0.0008 to 0.0025) versus plain logistic `h2_full` 0.6377. `logistic_l2` `h3_split` is +0.0010. `logistic_l2` `h3_replace` is +0.0015. Fold-tuned L2 does not help. Those fits still reject the H3 splits, so the H3 rejection is not collinearity noise.

EPA filter (`docs/experiments/reports/epa_filter_check.md`): `play = 1` rows are pass 528,368 (53.6%), run 388,724 (39.5%), and no_play 68,233 (6.9%). No special-teams play types. Only 36 kneels and 70 spikes have `play = 1`. The contamination is the `no_play` (penalty) rows, not special teams. That finding drives H4.

Accept a Phase 2 feature set only when pooled log loss improves by at least 0.003 and the 95% interval lies entirely below 0. The ridge setup rule is separate: switch the reference to `logistic_l2` on `h2_full` only when its `log_loss_diff` is <= 0. This run did not.

## Commands

Every `--cv` command uses rolling-origin seasons 2016-2023. Train on `season < S` and score `season == S`. 2024 is the final validation and is not a fold. 2025 is not scored. Each command also scores the home prior, Elo, and the market.

- Phase 1: `python -m src.train.train --cv`. Reference `baseline-home`. Local report `reports/phase1/`. Experiment `nfl_pregame/phase1_baselines`, tag `phase=1`.
- H1: `python -m src.train.train --cv --phase 2 --hypothesis h1`. Scores logistic `current`, `diff`, and `diff_only` against logistic `current`. Local report `reports/phase2/`. Tags `phase=2`, `hypothesis=h1-diff`.
- H2: `python -m src.train.train --cv --phase 2 --hypothesis h2 --reference-model logistic --reference-feature-set current`. Scores `current`, `h2_def`, and `h2_full` against logistic `current`. Local report `reports/phase2_h2/`. Tag `hypothesis=h2-season-def-regression`.
- H3: `python -m src.train.train --cv --phase 2 --hypothesis h3`. Scores `h2_full`, `h3_split`, and `h3_replace` against logistic `h2_full`. Local report `reports/phase2_h3/`. Tag `hypothesis=h3-pass-rush-epa`.
- Ridge: `make train-cv` (Windows: `.\scripts\dev.ps1 train-cv`). Scores logistic `h2_full` and `logistic_l2` on `h2_full`, `h3_split`, and `h3_replace` against logistic `h2_full`. `logistic_l2` chooses C inside each training fold. The scored season is not used to pick C. Local report `reports/phase2_ridge/`. Tag `hypothesis=ridge-reference`. Run the warehouse sequence in `repo-map.mdc` before this target.
- EPA filter: `make check-epa-filter` (Windows: `.\scripts\dev.ps1 check-epa-filter`). Writes `reports/epa_filter_check.md`. It does not change dbt models.

## Snapshots

`reports/` at the repo root is gitignored scratch. Do not commit it.

`docs/experiments/reports/` holds frozen snapshots. Add or replace one only when that hypothesis is decided. Do not hand-edit the numbers. Link each experiment note to its snapshot. The index is `docs/experiments/reports/README.md`.
